  "category": "Electromechanical",
  "prefix": "U",
  "description": "Three half-bridges with IN and EN per phase (DRV8313 style): EN high connects OUT, to VM while IN is high and to GND while it is low; EN low leaves OUT open (body diodes to VM and GND). PWM goes on IN; with the microcontroller's step averages the output is the average voltage. Experimental (E-11)",
